Date: Tue, 14 Jul 2026 14:14:59 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?feat:=20beta.10=20=E2=80=94=20live=20status=20b?=
 =?UTF-8?q?elow=20prose,=20fix=20restart-to-update,=20banner-only=20update?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20UX?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- ActivityStrip renders twice: header instance keeps the settled 'Worked for Xs'
  toggle + trail collapse; new live instance puts the running shimmer BELOW the
  streamed prose (intent line suppressed once real prose exists).
- Fix quitAndInstall never swapping versions: Squirrel.Mac closes windows via
  'before-quit-for-update' (native autoUpdater event) without 'before-quit', so
  the macOS hide-on-close handler preventDefaulted the close and stalled the
  quit — flag now flips on that event AND in the install IPC handler
  (setImmediate so the IPC reply lands first).
- Drop the native update dialog: the themed in-app banner is the only update
  surface; autoInstallOnAppQuit still covers banner-dismissers.
